{"id":"154d396d8d0ed575","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level.md","title":"ZFC Borel Hierarchy Level","display":"df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Borel Hierarchy Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level"],"display":"df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Borel Hierarchy Level","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-hierarchy]]","[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Borel Hierarchy Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\alpha,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(A,\\alpha,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel pointclasses, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,\\alpha,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land1\\leq\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\lor A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,\\alpha,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land1\\leq\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\lor A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Borel level is relative to a topology, and the level index is a nonzero countable ordinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}$ (topology predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau)$ (Borel pointclasses, see [[58-df-hierarchy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"A,\\alpha,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau),\\boldsymbol\\Pi^0_\\alpha(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,\\alpha,X,\\tau) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land1\\leq\\alpha<\\omega_1\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\Bigl(A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\lor A\\in\\boldsymbol{\\Pi}^{0}_{\\alpha}(X,\\tau)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1380,"backlinks":[{"id":"8e19dda6a33bf3e6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelHierarchyLevel}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch19/58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level.md]])"},{"id":"6c7e2c47ec8fa610","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1469","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[